"""One-shot, physically confirmed bootstrap of the local approval plane.

The public entry point elevates only through pkexec, copies itself into a
sealed root-owned memfd (no persistent mutation), validates the exact release,
then displays its identifiers.  The durable one-shot marker is the first
persistent write after the human confirmation.  Recovery entry points are
fixed and are used only by the two reviewed systemd guard units.
"""

